  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your foe hacks into your lower back, damaging your spinal column, hurling you to the ground and possibly also injuring your spinal cord.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You suffer the loss of the use of both legs – effectively a double @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.k00PimCWkff11IA0]{Amputation (Hard)} but roll only once. If you get successful Surgery the lost function of the legs instead change to @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.2iult41Jehz0F1O8]{Broken Bone (Major)} affecting both limbs as the surgeon manages to brace your back in such a way that your battered but un-severed spinal cord can recover. (A failure would possibly indicate a good brace but that the spinal cord really was severed after all.)</p>"
    },
